  "details": "It's time to upgrade the great feature Streamer Mode to a more customizable one.  While it's real nice to see that we can hide stuff, it is now needed give streamers more options to hide for privacy, copyright and other.\n\nWhile turned on, please give us to toggle features/options to hide such as:\n\ninstance ID numbers in searches and portal drops\n\ninstance creator username\n\nchat boxes (highly suggested)\n\navatars that have sexual, horror or other features to be hidden when turned on\n\nworld photo in details\n\nworld photo in search results\n\nhide either username or user's profile photo in details\n\ndeactivate the world's video player while playing any video on join\n\ngroup banners above usernames\n\nuser status under username plate\n\nfriend/group requests hidden AND sent to vrchat.com/home (and VRChat mobile app) under notifications as \"missed requests\" (VERY important feature).  Also be able to see it under notifications -> missed requests in our menu in VRChat.\n\nAnd to those who want privacy have a world option to notify users using streamer mode that the instance creator opted no streaming/recording.  This option will be in the world details when they are in their own instance.",
